Cell["\<\
The exact representation of the covariant derivative is only implicitly \
defined through the gauge quantum numbers of single field or composite \
operator that the derivative is acting on.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1163606804,ExpressionUUID->"84a01b55-07c1-4ec2-ae9c-062e59e27e3f"],

Cell[TextData[{
